# Netlify redirects. First match wins.

# One canonical host. www and the site's production netlify.app host move
# permanently to https://kullang.dev, files included (`!`). Deploy previews
# (pr-<n>--kullang-app.netlify.app) and deploy permalinks are other hosts,
# so they serve the site as they are.
https://www.kullang.dev/*          https://kullang.dev/:splat  301!
https://kullang-app.netlify.app/*  https://kullang.dev/:splat  301!

# The app is client-only: every /app path (and /app itself) is served the
# prerendered SPA shell, whose router renders the page.
/app/*  /_shell.html  200
